&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;新規発行株式数×１株当たりの払込金額&lt;/p&gt;
